  "schema_version": 1,
  "title": "Meshy CLI S1 endpoint contracts (frozen 2026-09-07)",
  "notes": [
    "This file is documentation of the frozen contract. src/client/resource-registry.ts is the executable source; tests/resource-registry.test.ts asserts both agree.",
    "billing 'may-charge' means the operation can consume credits on success; 'none' means the request is free. automaticRetry is false everywhere in S1.",
    "Relative paths are appended to the base URL of their API family. Default bases: v1 https://api.meshy.ai/openapi/v1, v2 https://api.meshy.ai/openapi/v2, creative-lab <v1 origin>/openapi/creative-lab, public-web <v1 origin>/web/public."
